oblem_40&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem 40 (page does not exist)\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U1\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U1\">U1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U2\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U2\">U2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U3\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U3\">U3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U4\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U4\">U4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U5\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U5\">U5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U6\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U6\">U6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U7\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U7\">U7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U8\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U8\">U8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U9 (page does not exist)\">U9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U10 (page does not exist)\">U10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017131002\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 211/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2881/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 659/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5775/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion e